WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.410
The Hook Lab reviews an edit before release.

2
00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:08.415
It helps the team understand what to change and why.

3
00:00:08.415 --> 00:00:14.215
It checks the opening, text, pace and message, using frames as evidence.

4
00:00:14.215 --> 00:00:19.315
The team tests a specific revision and records the response.

5
00:00:19.315 --> 00:00:23.065
Use test results to strengthen the next Snitch campaign.
